                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "display_formula",
            "block_content": " $$ \\Delta_{(t,d),\\theta}=100\\cdot\\frac{T_{\\theta}\\Big(\\mathcal{C}_{t,d}^{\\mathrm{c o n t a m}}\\Big)-T_{\\theta}\\Big(\\mathcal{C}_{t,d}^{\\mathrm{c l e a n}}\\Big)}{T_{\\theta}\\Big(\\mathcal{C}_{t,d}^{\\mathrm{c l e a n}}\\Big)}. $$ ",
