        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Permutation null. For $B = 500$ trials, contamination labels within each $(t, d)$ group are independently shuffled, preserving the marginal contaminated/clean ratio per group. The per-permutation mean gap $\\bar{\\Delta}^{(b)}$ is recorded; the one-sided $p$-value is $\\left(1 + \\#\\{b : \\bar{\\Delta}^{(b)} \\geq \\bar{\\Delta}^{\\mathrm{obs}}\\}\\right) / (B + 1)$.",
            "block_bbox": [
                125,
                699,
                1062,
                782
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
