                    782.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Negative control. For AIDA v2 (a Signal-A-clean benchmark), we assign random pseudocontamination scores  $ \\tilde{s}_c \\sim \\mathcal{U}(0,3) $ and apply the same stratification and analysis. A correctly calibrated test should produce mean gaps near zero with sign-test  $ p \\to 1 $.",
            "block_bbox": [
